2102	 * - Last block of a step (right before the next header): no downward overflow.
2103	 * - First / last child of the container: no overflow past the container edge.
2104	 *
2105	 * Degrades gracefully where :has() is unsupported: only a 7px same-step tail
2106	 * remains below a step's last block — still never crossing into the next step.
2107	 */
